Agent A: owners can revoke collaborators, effective immediately.

Adds DELETE /repos/:owner/:repo/collaborators/:username (remove-collaborator,
admin or owner) and Store.removeCollaborator, which emits collaborator.removed.

Premise relied on: permission evaluation freshness is at most per-request.
requirePermission reads the caller's role from the store on every request, so
a revoked collaborator's next request is refused. Nothing under src/authz/
changes.

Apply from fixtures/forge-lite on the base fixture: git apply scenarios/s1/a.patch

